{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109309","id":2718854384,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6iDmzw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109309","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109309.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109309.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109309","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109309/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109309/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109309/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/92d9227d4a4be234a44110d9d1e6c893add78f91","number":109309,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDExtension: Call startup callback only after reload is fully finished","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"It was brought up on chat.godotengine.org by @Yarwin that we're currently calling a GDExtension's startup callback _before_ the extension has been fully reloaded, when any objects that use its classes are in an inconsistent state.\r\n\r\nInstead, we'd want the startup callback to be called after reload is fully finished, so that the state is roughly the same as if the extension was being loaded for the first time.\r\n\r\nThis PR attempts to do that, by moving the \"after load\" stuff into a `_finish_load_extension()` method, which won't be called automatically on reload, so that the reload process can call it at the end\r\n\r\nThis startup callback was functionality added for Godot 4.5, it'd be good to get the order correct before release","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sau